  "details": "If on a country in development a VRChat Plus subscription is quite literally more expensive than the cost of a year of Crunchyroll then we got to talk about how you guys have to remember not every player earns as much as the american hourly income!\n\nI am making this example with crunchyroll because it's quite literally 10USD is how much it costs on Lebanon to pay for a year of that service.\n\nI'm from Mexico and I only used the service for one month because it was too expensive for me to pay for, it costs more than the 4k Netflix membership...\n\nPlease really consider not everyone in this game community is an american or someone from a country with a highly valued currency and we are really interested in support the game too",
